sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant UI as Frontend
  participant API as Backend
  participant K as Kitchen
  participant DB as Database

  U->>UI: Open menu & place order
  UI->>API: POST /orders {items}
  API->>DB: persist order (status: received)
  API->>K: push order event (websocket/queue)
  K-->>API: ack / update status
  API->>DB: update order status (preparing -> ready)
  API-->>UI: order status updates (realtime)
  UI->>U: notify delivered
